"208064":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/208064-I5bWldsHj4V7.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"CN","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c95d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208064-DpClKq6sMzhC.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208064-DpClKq6sMzhC.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208064-DpClKq6sMzhC.png"},"description":"A chance encounter between young Tang Zhi and a dragon maiden unexpectedly awakened his \"Heavenly Eye\"—allowing him to see gods and spirits roaming the mortal realm. These unique eyes led him into a world that coexisted with the mundane. Through unforgettable experiences, Tang Zhi made friends with all sorts of people and experienced laughter and warmth in seemingly ordinary yet subtly wondrous daily moments. An ordinary scholar, encountering and accompanying a group of gods and spirits with diverse personalities amidst the everyday life of the mortal world—this story of adventure, friendship, and growth is slowly unfolding.<br><br>(Source: Bangumi, translated)","duration":7,"endDate":{"day":13,"month":7,"year":2026},"episodes":26,"favourites":2,"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Fantasy"],"id":208064,"idMal":63427,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":53,"popularity":131,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":2,"month":2,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":7267,"name":"Panda Tower Studio"}],"tags":[{"id":82,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":20},{"id":208,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Mythology","rank":20},{"id":772,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Shapeshifting","rank":20},{"id":193,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Episodic","rank":20}],"title":{"english":"Tang Zhi's Strange Tales","native":"汤直志异","romaji":"Tang Zhi Zhi Yi"},"trailer":{"id":"152xy1DqhUw","site":"youtube"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1792142105},
"208065":{"countryOfOrigin":"CN","coverImage":{"color":"#5dbbf1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208065-eryEusVwlDgg.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208065-eryEusVwlDgg.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208065-eryEusVwlDgg.jpg"},"description":"Lele, a white dog, and Xiaoliang, a gray one-eyed cat, run a struggling convenience store. Besides selling goods, they also take on commissions to earn money. The story follows Lele and Xiaoliang as they complete various tasks, experiencing a series of small adventures together—stories about courage, understanding, and learning how to love and be loved.<br><br>(Source: Bilibili, translated)","duration":10,"endDate":{"day":1,"month":4,"year":2026},"episodes":10,"favourites":0,"format":"ONA","genres":["Fantasy","Slice of Life"],"id":208065,"idMal":63415,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":58,"popularity":55,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":4,"month":2,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":6333,"name":"Sharefun Studio"}],"synonyms":["Lele Convenience Store"],"title":{"native":"乐乐便利店","romaji":"Lele Bianlidian"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1792055652},
"208066":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208066-brPrpgmbXgUV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208066-brPrpgmbXgUV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208066-brPrpgmbXgUV.jpg"},"description":"At the Hudsucker corporate headquarters, a salaryman (“Me”) is the constant target of his hulking, bald, perverted boss’ violent retribution. Bittersweet childhood memories of Me’s late grandmother keep him going, but his brutal work life pushes him to the breaking point. Me gets sweet revenge and hightails it out of Tokyo, only to have his airplane violently hijacked. He’s dumped into the Pacific Ocean and onto the shores of remote island Mahoroba (an ancient Japanese word describing a far-off utopia).<br><br>\n\n<i>Note: Screened at the 13th Shimokitazawa Film Festival on September 20, 2021, where it also won the Grand Prize among 12 nominated works.</i>","duration":14,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":9,"year":2021},"episodes":1,"favourites":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama"],"id":208066,"idMal":54636,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":55,"popularity":90,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2021,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":20,"month":9,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","tags":[{"id":1571,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Office","rank":79},{"id":82,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":79},{"id":874,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Pandemic","rank":79},{"id":1046,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Suicide","rank":79},{"id":1537,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Coastal","rank":60},{"id":143,"isMediaSpoiler":true,"name":"Survival","rank":60}],"title":{"english":"MAHOROBA","native":"MAHOROBA","romaji":"MAHOROBA"},"trailer":{"id":"41igBne023I","site":"youtube"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1792228538},
"208067":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208067-3wDn5eegVjkU.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208067-3wDn5eegVjkU.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208067-3wDn5eegVjkU.jpg"},"description":"Midnight. A construction site. A man with a colored corn head and a woman with pink hair meet in a powerful encounter. A provocative tale of love, right and wrong over a quarter of a century between two outcasts. A sensational subject matter and a staggered ethical viewpoints are explored in this latest work of the artist’s best work! We run, leaving the world behind.<br><br>\n\n<i>Note: Won the Japanese Grand Prize at the 9th New Chitose Airport International Animation Festival in 2022.</i>","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":9,"year":2022},"episodes":1,"favourites":0,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama"],"id":208067,"idMal":61572,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":51,"popularity":71,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2022,"source":"ORIGINAL","startDate":{"day":24,"month":9,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Lawless Love","native":"無法の愛","romaji":"Muhou no Ai"},"trailer":{"id":"OtVDpBqPho8","site":"youtube"},"type":"ANIME","updatedAt":1792055652},
