"208225":{"averageScore":67,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4bb28","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx208225-HJbCC0Z4xRp3.jpg"},"description":"Elsa, the daughter of a fallen aristocrat, receives news. It was a marriage proposal from Julius, a very elite nobleman. Elsa is wondering,\" Why would such a distinguished man marry me\"? But after the wedding, Julius, who had been kind and gentle up to that point, changed completely! In a cold voice, he tells her,\" I have no intention of loving you\".\n<br><br>\n(Source: MangaPlaza)","duration":23,"endDate":{"day":20,"month":9,"year":2026},"episodes":12,"favourites":190,"format":"TV","genres":["Fantasy","Romance"],"id":208225,"idMal":63537,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":68,"popularity":13704,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2026,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":6117,"name":"Zero-G"},{"id":7795,"name":"Grass"}],"synonyms":["きみ愛","KimiAi"],"tags":[{"id":1045,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Heterosexual","rank":79},{"id":53,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Shoujo","rank":79},{"id":1578,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Arranged Marriage","rank":75},{"id":1433,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Marriage","rank":73},{"id":98,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60},{"id":1327,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Royal Affairs","rank":55},{"id":109,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Primarily Adult Cast","rank":50},{"id":780,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Ojou-sama","rank":20},{"id":1752,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Medieval","rank":20}],"title":{"english":"The Duke’s Son Claims He Won’t Love Me Yet Showers Me with Adoration","native":"「きみを愛する気はない」と言った次期公爵様がなぜか溺愛してきます","romaji":"\"Kimi wo Aisuru K