"208352":{"averageScore":71,"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4d65d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b208352-KUuXI4sVbtYV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b208352-KUuXI4sVbtYV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b208352-KUuXI4sVbtYV.jpg"},"description":"Dandelion follows Tetsuo Tanba and Misaki Kurogane, members of the Japanese Angel Federation’s Send-Off Department. Their job? Tracking down restless earthbound spirits and gently guiding them to the afterlife.<br><br>\n\nWhile other angels rush to close their cases, the 21st Division’s Dandelion Clan takes a different approach. Dandelion members Tetsuo Tanba and his leader, Misaki Kurogane, listen to each spirit’s regrets and help them resolve what’s holding them back. They even help a spirit who’s an elderly man running at full speed, desperate to escape.<br><br>\n\nThe angels themselves are full of surprises. Tanba’s permanent scowl and sharp tongue mask a deeply compassionate nature, while Kurogane is a formidable force — despite her girlish appearance. She’s rumored to have laid to rest the legendary soul of Musashi Miyamoto.<br><br>\n(Source: Netflix)","duration":29,"endDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2026},"episodes":7,"favourites":131,"format":"ONA","genres":["Action","Comedy","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#だんでらいおん #dandelion","id":208352,"idMal":63572,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":71,"popularity":8884,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":951,"name":"NAZ"}],"synonyms":["Dente-de-Leão","Одуванчик","ダンデライオン","Diente de León","Pampelišky"],"tags":[{"id":281,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Surreal Comedy","rank":84},{"id":1068,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Angels","rank":84},{"id":321,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":79},{"id":208,"isMediaSpo